Plain, *emphasized*, **strong**, **bold**, <u>underlined</u> and
<s>struck</s> runs.

Water is H<sub>2</sub>O and the area is r<sup>2</sup>.

A “quotation ‘inside’ another” alternates its marks.

Code faces: `literal`, `ls`, `/etc/hosts`, `strlen`, `Widget`, `PATH`,
`--verbose`, `done`, `MAX`, `count`, `<br/>`, and `(...)`.

Fill in \<name\> and maybe \[a flag\].

A *lingua franca* and a *word*.

A bare phrase carries nothing extra.

Press <span class="keycombo">Ctrl+C</span> or pick
<span class="menuchoice">File \> Save</span>.

An <span id="spot"></span>anchored spot.
